<title>GERMANY: Kolbenschmidt fist-half sales up 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Kolbenschmidt fist-half sales up 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>German car components group Kolbenschmidt AG said on Wednesday sales in the first half of 1996/97 rose 18 percent to 681 million marks.</p>
<p>Pretax profit in the period rose 3.4 percent to 34 million, the company said in a statement.</p>
